    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**OPEN VIEWING 18TH OF AUGUST 5:30 - 7:30pm**\r\n\r\nWhite Linen is the latest high-quality development delivered by Faughnan Construction comprising a mix of stylish and modern 2 and 3 bed mid and end terrace homes in Co. Longford. \r\nStep inside and discover homes thoughtfully designed to combine modern style, exceptional quality, and everyday comfort. Each residence showcases superior craftsmanship, contemporary kitchens, and carefully considered layouts that create bright, functional living spaces for modern family life.\r\nBuilt to the latest building standards, these A-rated homes incorporate innovative, energy-efficient technology, including air-to-water heat pump systems, delivering year-round comfort, healthier indoor air quality, lower energy consumption, and reduced running costs. Designed with sustainability at their core, these homes offer the perfect balance of quality crafted, efficiency, and future-proof living.\r\nAccommodation comprising open plan kitchen-dining area, spacious sitting room, w.c on ground floor. The first floor living space contains two bedrooms and bathroom. \r\nThis home will qualify for the Help to Buy & First Home schemes which helps first-time buyers purchase a newly built house or apartment. \r\nFor more information and to register your interest, please contact James L. Murtagh Auctioneers"
      },
